  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth in Jubaland, Southwest, Hirshabelle, Galmudug, Puntland States and Banadir of Somalia, will access quality, demand driven TVET delivered through ASPIRE&#x2019;s strengthened partnership with MOE and private sector engagement. It will strengthen pathways to decent jobs. This targets IDPs, girls, youth with disabilities, and other vulnerable youth living in rural, peri-urban and urban areas. ASPIRE will facilitate job placements through local businesses, job fairs and start-up kits.</narrative>
  </description>
